            "contextual_comparison": "Contrasts with smaller studies suggesting pre-ICI antibiotics are detrimental; this large-scale analysis indicates post-initiation exposure carries greater risk. Aligns with Poizeau et al. for melanoma null findings but contrasts with literature characterizing lung cancer as particularly susceptible.",
            "limitations_noted_in_study": [
