        "auxiliary_material": "The authors explicitly state that this is a phase 2 trial, not a phase 3 trial. They mention that the findings will be assessed as part of the CanBiome2 randomized trial (NCT06623461), which is described as a randomized trial evaluating FMT in combination with ICI in 128 patients, but the current paper does not report the results of this phase 3 trial. The study design was open-label and single-arm for the cohorts reported here, lacking the randomization required for a phase 3 RCT status.",
